**4. Intangible Asset Turnover Analysis** (Indicator #3):
   - Formula: Revenue Ã· Intangible Assets
   - {MainModel.BaseYear}: [turnover] UAH revenue per UAH of intangibles
   - {MainModel.CurrentYear}: [turnover] UAH revenue per UAH of intangibles
   - Change: [absolute], [percentage]%
   
   **Interpretation:**
   - This measures how effectively intangible assets generate revenue
   - VERY HIGH turnover (>100) = Highly efficient, lean intangible base
