    â€¢ R&D investment priorities
    â€¢ IP acquisition vs organic development
    â€¢ Brand building vs other priorities
    â€¢ Software/technology investments
    
    **Monetization Opportunities**:
    â€¢ Licensing unused patents or IP
    â€¢ Franchising brands
    â€¢ Software-as-a-service models
