    â€¢ IP portfolio optimization
    
    **Protection and Management**:
    â€¢ IP protection strategies
    â€¢ Patent renewal decisions
    â€¢ Trademark enforcement
    â€¢ Software license management
    â€¢ Customer relationship preservation
    
    **Implementation Timeline**:
    â€¢ Immediate (30 days): Intangible asset inventory and audit
